      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mobile%2C_Alabama",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "French colonists founded Old Mobile in 1702 south of Native villages on the Mobile River, establishing the first European settlement in the area.",
